# Deliberately no apple_id / password here.
#
# App Store Connect enforces two-factor auth, so an Apple ID + password cannot
# drive an unattended upload — it would stall waiting for a 6-digit code. The
# App Store Connect API key (.p8) in the Fastfile is the supported credential
# and is what CI must use. See fastlane/README.md.
